  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251280,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same over exactly the same time frame. \nBecause these days there is just a lot more  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255680,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money slloshing around these teams all trying to \nbuy an edge wherever they can find one. We just  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260480,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
